339
00:28:29,820 --> 00:28:36,560
Thermal imaging presents a picture showing the heat coming from men, machines, and other objects, whether natural or man-made.

340
00:28:36,561 --> 00:28:44,560
It can penetrate darkness, plain smoke, thick fog and visual camouflage.

341
00:28:44,561 --> 00:28:49,520
Infrared light emitted by objects is scanned by infrared detectors.

342
00:28:49,521 --> 00:28:54,420
Thermal imaging creates a detailed temperature pattern called a thermogram.

343
00:28:54,421 --> 00:28:59,380
The thermogram is translated into electric impulses, which are sent to a signal processing

344
00:28:59,381 --> 00:29:01,540
