00:33:58,700 --> 00:34:02,140
The trademark of a sniper is his camouflaged ghillie suit.

398
00:34:02,860 --> 00:34:07,580
The ghillie suit is a garment covered or garnished with numerous strips and strands of cloth,

399
00:34:08,300 --> 00:34:11,960
