424
00:36:22,220 --> 00:36:26,420
The solid, light-colored background gives the patterns a neutral, soft edge.

425
00:36:27,800 --> 00:36:30,700
Developing a pattern is very much a collaborative process.

426
00:36:31,420 --> 00:36:35,700
It begins with gathering samples from the environment in which the new pattern will be used.

427
00:36:36,420 --> 00:36:38,760
Basically, wherever people hunt, that's where we go.

428
00:36:39,100 --> 00:36:42,280
We try to get out there at the time of day when somebody would be hunting.

429
00:36:42,281 --> 00:36:48,220
We look for commonalities, trees, limbs, leaves, things that help to break up the human outline.

430
00:36:48,221 --> 00:36:52,940
Elements under observation are documented on film and video

431
00:36:52,941 --> 00:36:57,040
