434
00:37:06,900 --> 00:37:08,660
Thousands of images are culled.

435
00:37:09,520 --> 00:37:12,640
The hundreds of likely images left over are then digitized.

436
00:37:13,780 --> 00:37:17,340
We manipulate colors. We move things around.

437
00:37:17,341 --> 00:37:22,560
You slide a leaf in under a branch and that doesn't work, so you put it above the branch.

438
00:37:23,520 --> 00:37:28,380
