439
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:34,360
With our Realtree and Advantage camouflage patterns, we have over 900 licensing contracts.

440
00:37:34,820 --> 00:37:38,020
So anything that has to do with the outdoor environment, we can put patterns on.

441
00:37:38,920 --> 00:37:44,080
