00:42:02,020 --> 00:42:08,700
Radar-deflecting shapes similar to those found on the B-2 and F-22 were applied to an experimental truck.

487
00:42:09,500 --> 00:42:16,680
Initial tests showed promise, but what didn't work were the radar-absorbent materials that were also tried on similar vehicles.

