492
00:42:44,301 --> 00:42:50,020
The B-2's design enjoyed partial success with its curved surfaces,

493
00:42:50,620 --> 00:42:55,160
but it took today's advancements in computing to bring it all together.

494
00:42:56,300 --> 00:43:02,660
With the advent of the computer processing that allows us to really compute for the compound curve kinds of designs,

495
00:43:03,000 --> 00:43:07,320
we're able now to have a very close synergy between aerodynamic performance

496
00:43:07,321 --> 00:43:11,360
and the ability to limit and reduce radar cross-section.

497
00:43:11,361 --> 00:43:20,900
Most camouflage experts are aware that modern technology makes it much easier for one adversary to see through another adversary's camouflage.

498
00:43:24,840 --> 00:43:32,520
But they're neither daunted by the challenge nor concerned with the growing idea that visual camouflage is now of secondary importance.

499
00:43:34,140 --> 00:43:37,760
I happen to believe that technology isn't rendering camouflage ineffective.

500
00:43:38,000 --> 00:43:39,640
I think we have to stay ahead of the game.

501
00:43:39,641 --> 00:43:47,560
And in terms of the work that we do here, we have to develop countermeasures against these detection devices as they come online.

502
00:43:49,720 --> 00:43:55,700
Advances in camouflage and counter-camouflage will become more and more sophisticated as technology improves.

503
00:43:56,340 --> 00:43:59,980
